# Build artifacts from ti/build_ti.{ps1,sh} and the CMake stub build.
# The TI build drops a ~14 MB .out and a ~2 MB .map here; none of it belongs
# in history (the shippable image is signed and published under prebuilt/).
build/

# Cygwin/MSYS crash dumps.  The Windows bench shell drops these in the repo
# root and `git add -A` has swept them into history more than once.
*.stackdump

# Firmware binaries.  Build output never belongs in history; the four signed,
# published images under prebuilt/ are re-included by prebuilt/.gitignore.
*.bin

# The staged OTA self-test candidate: a bin2c C byte-array of a signed TI GPE
# vendor image.  Binary blobs are internal-class per alp-sdk #590 and this is a
# PUBLIC repository -- the file is staged from alp-sdk-internal for a local
# -OtaSelftest / -OtaWindowSelftest build and never committed here.
# See hal/ti/cc3501e_ota_candidate.README.md.
hal/ti/cc3501e_ota_candidate.c

# In-tree drop of the TI SimpleLink CC33xx SDK (the `-DSIMPLELINK_SDK_DIR`
# alternative).  TI's SDK is not redistributable; extract it here if you want
# an in-tree build, but it stays out of history.
# See vendor/simplelink-cc33xx/README.md.
vendor/simplelink-cc33xx/sdk/
